esistance Rating</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Legendary_Cloak_of_the_Zephyr.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Legendary_Cloak_of_the_Zephyr.png/420px-Legendary_Cloak_of_the_Zephyr.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"724\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Legendary_Cloak_of_the_Zephyr.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#DDAAFF\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EEDDFF\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\"><i>This diaphanous wrap enables its wearer to fade from sight.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260816234610\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.106 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.159 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 5234/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 35851/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 13109/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4051/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  137.782      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  137.782      1 -total\n 98.04%  135.081      1 Template:Named_Clothing\n 95.60%  131.720     68 Template:IO\n 31.04%   42.772      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 30.41%   41.902      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 29.78%   41.029      2 Template:IsSpeculati